The consultation for application **26/01388/LBC** (The Old Schoolhouse, Burnside Lane, proposed replacement sash windows) closes on **25 September**. The application is currently under consideration, with a decision due by **16 October**.

Since the consultation closes on 25 September, you have until then to submit any comments. If you'd like to comment, please do so through the council's planning portal or the planning desk before that date.
